^SAMPLE = GSM8292111
!Sample_title = S1
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM8292111
!Sample_status = Public on Jun 01 2025
!Sample_submission_date = May 28 2024
!Sample_last_update_date = Jun 01 2025
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = Brain
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Mus musculus
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 10090
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: Brain
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = Sex: Male
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype: C57BL/6J
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: Sham
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Transient middle cerebral artery occlusion (tMCAO) was performed as described [20]. In brief, mice were anesthetized with isoflurane delivered in a mixture of 30% O2 and 70% N2O, which was controlled by an anesthesia apparatus. For this purpose, an incision was made in the midline neck region and the common carotid artery, using a silicone-coated monofilament (210−230 µm tip diameter; Doccol, Sharon, MA, USA) inserted into the right internal carotid artery. After 50 min of occlusion, the filament was removed. For the survival period, the mice were kept in their home cages with free access to water and food. The body temperature was maintained throughout surgery using a heating pad.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = The mice were housed in a 12:12 h light:dark cycle (light on from 07:00−19:00 h), with controlled temperature of 22-24 °C, humidity of 40%~67%, and food and water provided ad libitum.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Mice were anesthetized with chloral hydrate (4.2%, 0.01 mL/g) and underwent transcardial perfusion with 40 mL of pre-cooled 0.9% NaCl, right hippocampus were isolated. Total RNA was extracted and mRNA was isolated using magnetic beads with oligo-dT, the mRNA was then segmented, the cDNA were synthesized and end repaired. A base was added to the 3’end and the segment was connected to the sequencing connector, which was then purified and amplified, the sequencing library was purified by magnetic beads. Qubit was used to detect the library concentration, and agilent fragment analyzer was used to detect the library fragment length.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA-Libraries for RNA-Seq were prepared using SMARTER mRNA-Seq Libraries prep kit following manufacture’s protocols
!Sample_data_processing = Sequence reads were trimmed for adaptor sequence/low-quality sequence using GLC genomics bench work (Parameter-Quality: 0.05)
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: Tab-delimited text file include RPKM values for each sample
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: Tab-delimited text file include raw count for each sample
